'''Last of the Dead (Merciless)''' is an [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] unlocked after clearing [[Clionel Dominant]]. It was added in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]] and appears on the '''7th''', '''8th''', '''21st''' and '''22nd''' of every month. Upon completion, players have a 30% chance to unlock [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Phantom Cat]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

