==Trivia==
*Last of the Dead's Japanese name, Saigo no Shisha (最後の死者, lit. "The Final Dead Person"), sounds identical to the Japanese title of ''[[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event|Neon Genesis Evangelion]]'' [https://wiki.evageeks.org/Episode_24 Episode 24]; the only difference is that unlike this stage's name, the episode title spells ''Shisha'' as シ者, allowing it to be interpreted as either "The Final Dead Person" or "The Final Messenger". This wordplay is used in [[Cruel Angel Clionel]]'s Japanese description as well.

